er-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-121237/selection/ma-v1/a616ec38c2df8fe41b4149c98644b274db204370060af9d555d694ec10d4d43d/c8a570a7a45299d6bca7534749498af91d95f2281bdd8454030e707cf44ee838" :answer-field/choices ["q-121237/selection/ma-v1/a616ec38c2df8fe41b4149c98644b274db204370060af9d555d694ec10d4d43d/46070df805b4653a5d877039a93fbcfb0cf7186aafc46672fa7e330153961054" "q-121237/selection/ma-v1/a616ec38c2df8fe41b4149c98644b274db204370060af9d555d694ec10d4d43d/6ec7f55390e84a805c2f4b28c93f893967d5f7a64eeb901750d34dda29cf16f4" "q-121237/selection/ma-v1/a616ec38c2df8fe41b4149c98644b274db204370060af9d555d694ec10d4d43d/e4d5cbdd1dc7cc0dd0fdf2a9056c717b9f60123484c35fc7a65c937abab9db2f" "q-121237/selection/ma-v1/a616ec38c2df8fe41b4149c98644b274db204370060af9d555d694ec10d4d43d/bab4acf5ca3a66ed4f11bbcf7574627e6848417923ee89f9393917451c190309" "q-121237/selection/ma-v1/a616ec38c2df8fe41b4149c98644b274db204370060af9d555d694ec10d4d43d/c8a570a7a45299d6bca7534749498af91d95f2281bdd8454030e707cf44ee838"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-121237"] :question/problem "Consider the expression $f(x,y)=2{x}^{2}y.$ What are the missing entries in the following sign table of $f(x,y)?$\n\n| $y>0$ |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $y<0$ |  |  |\n|  | $x<0$ | $x>0$ |" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $f(x,y)$ equals zero when $x=0$ and $y=0.$ These lines divide the $xy$-plane into four regions, as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004890/assets/c35c98904d2a0d0d6d49c582cd9f9dba9d96e91ae0da5deb2d329f38f77532e3.png)\n\nTo determine the sign of $f(x,y)$ in each region, we pick four test points, one for each region.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004890/assets/9340582eaad37c4ce1e0c8cbcdce48faec1e36c3c05adbedd61aa2de7168fd2f.png)\n\nNext, we calculate the sign of $f(x,y)$ in each region using a sign table:\n\n|  | Test point | $2{x}^{2}$ | $y$ | $f(x,y)$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Top-Left | $(-1,1)$ | $+$ | $+$ | $+$ |\n| Top-Right | $(1,1)$ | $+$ | $+$ | $+$ |\n| Bottom-Left | $(-1,-1)$ | $+$ | $-$ | $-$ |\n| Bottom-Right | $(1,-1)$ | $+$ | $-$ | $-$ |\n\n \nUsing the *last* column of the table above, we get the following picture:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14004890/assets/7c851189a040934728e1b312706b4727c141cc678a4be870b6057e281be6e0fd.png)\n\nFinally, we fill in the required sign table.\n\n| $y>0$ | $+$ | $+$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $y<0$ | $-$ | $-$ |\n|  | $x<0$ | $x>0$ |" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-121237/selection/ma-v1/a616ec38c2df8fe41b4149c98644b274db204370060af9d555d694ec10d4d43d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-317187/field-1/4e1443bd31b83d9674b14c2b39fdc69b7291d3991d33de8027815afac4720949" :answer/id #uuid "49ab8625-6abd-5b84-9128-945e67d0fce3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "+" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317187/field-1/ccfe516fb6b2e6a04cc571ee2ff57ef9ea3f598a00c4bac0e1422b5f957652bc" :answer/id #uuid "a7dc5479-09ca-5035-8446-797ffbdbd5a7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317187/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "977e0f70-2c9b-50d4-830e-d1630ef23b8a" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-317187/field-1/ccfe516fb6b2e6a04cc571ee2ff57ef9ea3f598a00c4bac0e1422b5f957652bc" :answer-field/choices ["q-317187/field-1/4e1443bd31b83d9674b14c2b39fdc69b7291d3991d33de8027815afac4720949" "q-317187/field-1/ccfe516fb6b2e6a04cc571ee2ff57ef9ea3f598a00c4bac0e1422b5f957652bc"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317187/field-2/4e1443bd31b83d9674b14c2b39fdc69b7291d3991d33de8027815afac4720949" :answer/id #uuid "5422a133-8716-53af-9f39-73fd9d5f036d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "+" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]}